				{
					"Type": "NodeCodeBlockCode",
					"Data": "int Recur(int n)\n{\n    if (n == 1)\n        return 1;\n    int res = Recur(n - 1);\n    return n + res;\n}\n\nConsole.WriteLine($\"{nameof(Recur)}: {Recur(3)}\");\n"
